Third-party components
----------------------

The packaged jar and the build/test toolchain include the following
third-party components. License identifiers below were taken from the
POMs in the local Maven repository used to build this project; where a
POM did not declare a license, the upstream project's published license
is stated.

Runtime dependencies:

  * Spring Boot, Spring Framework, Spring Data, Spring Security,
    Spring Web, Spring WebSocket, Spring Integration and Spring AOP
    (org.springframework) - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * Hibernate ORM and hibernate-community-dialects (org.hibernate.orm)
    - Apache License, Version 2.0. (Hibernate 7.x relicensed from the
    LGPL 2.1 used by older releases; the local POMs declare Apache-2.0.)
  * SQLite JDBC (org.xerial:sqlite-jdbc) - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * Flyway database migrations (org.flywaydb:flyway-core) - Apache
    License, Version 2.0 (upstream project license; the published POM
    does not declare a license element).
  * Nimbus JOSE+JWT (com.nimbusds:nimbus-jose-jwt) - Apache License,
    Version 2.0.
  * Jackson databind (tools.jackson.core / com.fasterxml.jackson.core)
    - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * SnakeYAML (org.yaml:snakeyaml) - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * PostgreSQL JDBC Driver (org.postgresql:postgresql) - BSD-2-Clause
    (PostgreSQL License).
  * Micrometer (io.micrometer) - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * pty4j (org.jetbrains.pty4j) - Apache License, Version 2.0.
  * SLF4J API (org.slf4j) - MIT License.
  * Logback (ch.qos.logback) - dual licensed under the Eclipse Public
    License 2.0 and the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1.
  * Jakarta Persistence API (jakarta.persistence) - Eclipse Public
    License 2.0 / Eclipse Distribution License 1.0 (dual licensed).

Build and test dependencies (not shipped in the runtime jar):

  * ArchUnit (com.tngtech.archunit) - Apache License, Version 2.0 and
    BSD License (dual licensed).
  * JUnit 5 (org.junit.jupiter) - Eclipse Public License 2.0.
  * Mockito (org.mockito) - MIT License.
  * Testcontainers (org.testcontainers) - MIT License.

The browser workbench has its own dependency notices under web/; consult
the licenses of the dependencies declared in web/package.json.
